OL,3,AHundreds missing, including 291 foreign
OL,4,Atourists, after flash flood on
OL,5,ANepal-Tibet border
OL,6,
OL,7,FHundreds of travellers are missing,
OL,8,Fincluding at least 291 foreign
OL,9,Ftourists, after a flash flood on the
OL,10,FNepal-Tibet border
OL,12,FNepal's tourist board says the
OL,13,Fpreliminary list of the missing
OL,14,Fincludes more than 100 people from
OL,15,FIndia and 12 from the UK
OL,17,FAt least 17 people are known to have
OL,18,Fbeen killed
