OL,3,AHundreds missing, including 291 foreign
OL,4,Atourists, after flash flood on
OL,5,ANepal-Tibet border
OL,6,
OL,7,FNepal's foreign minister says
OL,8,Fpreliminary reports show it may have
OL,9,Fbeen caused by an earthquake triggering
OL,10,Fan avalanche, which lead to flash
OL,11,Ffloods
OL,13,FImages show devastation, with houses
OL,14,Fpartially submerged after muddy
OL,15,Ffloodwater swept through Nepal's
OL,16,FNuwakot district
